ENS Chatbot Platform — Why It Matters

The ENS Chatbot Platform is designed to become a single intelligent entry point for all automation, configuration, and query needs across the ENS ecosystem. Instead of users jumping between tools, scripts, or APIs, they can simply come to one interface — ask what they need — and get it done.

