What Makes It Unique

The strength of this design is its modular expert framework.
Each expert (like Config Expert, Audit Expert, or Execution Expert) can be plugged into the platform without changing the backend code — they just follow a defined schema. That means:
	•	New domains can be onboarded in minutes, not weeks.
	•	Different teams can contribute their own experts independently.
	•	The platform keeps expanding without breaking existing services.

This kind of architecture is rare — it blends conversational AI with microservice-based modularity.
It’s not just “a chatbot” — it’s a dynamic orchestration layer that connects AI intelligence, APIs, and automation tools under one roof.

