How It’s Useful

For daily operations, the chatbot can:
	•	Generate configurations on demand.
	•	Execute pre-approved automation jobs.
	•	Run diagnostics and provide contextual recommendations.
	•	Connect securely with form-wide APIs and OpenAI for intelligent responses.
	•	Track job executions, completion status, and notify users automatically.

It becomes the central point of interaction — whether you’re checking network health, deploying configs, or running Unix scripts.

