Why It’s Scalable

The scalability lies in its design philosophy — plug, not patch.
Every expert is independent. The core only cares about:
	•	Schema compliance
	•	Routing logic
	•	Standard response format

Because of that:
	•	The platform can grow horizontally (new experts/domains) and vertically (new capabilities) without redesign.
	•	It can even be adopted by other teams or business units — the architecture supports external integration easily.
	•	Load can be distributed or scaled independently per expert or per function.

So, in essence, it’s built for growth — technically, organizationally, and functionally.

